#v(2em)

This project proposes the development of a Comprehensive Management System for Bambú Restaurant, integrating Artificial Intelligence to optimize daily operations and enhance the customer experience. This system addresses the restaurant's current challenges, such as inefficient reservation management and in-person sales control, through the implementation of online reservation modules, point of sale (POS), and the integration of the Red Enlace payment gateway. Additionally, it introduces innovative features like a chatbot with semantic search, a dish recommendation system, demand prediction, and review sentiment analysis, providing a complete technological solution adapted to the Bolivian context.
